---

Pipe growth rules, camera behaviour and scene parameters are ported from
"pipes" by Isaiah Odhner (https://github.com/1j01/pipes), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2018 Isaiah Odhner, which itself follows the behaviour of the
original Microsoft OpenGL screen saver (Windows NT 4.0 SDK sample).

The Utah teapot tessellation in Teapot.swift is ported from
THREE.TeapotBufferGeometry by Eric Haines (three.js examples, MIT License),
using Martin Newell's original control point data.
